    <title lang="en">Episode 3: The secret ingredients</title></page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E03P01.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="76,34 201,34 201,57 77,57" bgcolor="#ffeb7b" type="commentary">
          <p>Komona City;</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="152,59 261,59 252,81 149,81 149,58" bgcolor="#ffeb7b" type="commentary">
          <p>Market day</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="92,892 96,866 115,846 253,844 276,858 291,880 289,903 273,930 249,949 207,961 158,956 113,941 98,924">
          <p>Good morning Sir, I would like eight pumpkinstars, please</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="435,883 436,863 444,850 454,844 566,843 585,852 594,862 597,875 592,895 579,907 562,907 513,902 450,900 438,890">
          <p>Here you are, that's 60Ko*</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="839,981 842,966 862,956 896,958 928,961 937,974 940,990 921,1000 858,998 843,992">
          <p>...Oh dear</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="366,1333 561,1333 561,1349 365,1349">
          <p>*Ko = Komona currency unit</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="76,34 201,34 201,57 77,57" bgcolor="#ffeb7b" type="commentary">
          <p>Ville de Komona,</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="152,59 261,59 252,81 149,81 149,58" bgcolor="#ffeb7b" type="commentary">
          <p>Jour de marché</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="92,892 96,866 115,846 253,844 276,858 291,880 289,903 273,930 249,949 207,961 158,956 113,941 98,924">
          <p>Bonjour Monsieur, je voudrais huit courgétoiles, s'il vous plait!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="435,883 436,863 444,850 454,844 566,843 585,852 594,862 597,875 592,895 579,907 562,907 513,902 450,900 438,890">
          <p>Et voici, ça fait 60Ko*</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="839,981 842,966 862,956 896,958 928,961 937,974 940,990 921,1000 858,998 843,992">
          <p>zut...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="366,1333 561,1333 561,1349 365,1349">
          <p>* Ko = unité monétaire de Komona</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="76,34 201,34 201,57 77,57" bgcolor="#ffeb7b" type="commentary">
          <p>Mesto Komona;</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="152,59 261,59 252,81 149,81 149,58" bgcolor="#ffeb7b" type="commentary">
          <p>Jarmočný deň</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="92,892 96,866 115,846 253,844 276,858 291,880 289,903 273,930 249,949 207,961 158,956 113,941 98,924">
          <p>Dobré ráno pane, chcela by som osem dyňohviezd, prosím</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="435,883 436,863 444,850 454,844 566,843 585,852 594,862 597,875 592,895 579,907 562,907 513,902 450,900 438,890">
          <p>Tu ich máš, bude to 60Ko*</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="839,981 842,966 862,956 896,958 928,961 937,974 940,990 921,1000 858,998 843,992">
          <p>...Och</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="366,1333 561,1333 561,1349 365,1349">
          <p>*Ko = Komonská menová jednotka</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="40,12 953,12 953,817 40,816"/>
      <frame points="40,841 355,841 356,1333 37,1334"/>
      <frame points="366,841 654,841 655,1347 365,1348"/>
      <frame points="666,841 954,840 954,1334 664,1334"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E03P02.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="191,257 196,239 216,226 282,223 336,226 357,231 368,243 373,257 369,272 342,288 304,297 263,301 238,300 208,289 193,272">
          <p>Uhh, sorry, I'll have to take only four...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="816,15 896,14 899,28 880,45 843,44 825,35 816,25">
          <p>Grrr...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="373,340 563,341 570,356 562,393 565,412 568,425 555,456 533,463 505,469 457,463 423,467 397,464 379,449 370,430 380,389 367,357">
          <p>Greetings, good Sir. Please prepare two dozen of everything for me. Premium quality, as usual.</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="378,568 387,543 409,524 449,512 494,510 532,524 549,541 558,562 556,584 537,603 452,606 428,601 405,601 387,590">
          <p>It's always a pleasure to serve you, Miss Saffron</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="458,688 462,673 474,658 524,653 567,657 590,673 599,693 591,710 573,718 484,719 466,707">
          <p>Hey look, it's Pepper</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="429,789 440,751 453,732 488,723 574,724 606,741 628,767 633,789 618,815 565,848 531,857 475,843 440,820 429,803">
          <p>Oh, let me guess business is booming in the countryside?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="625,912 628,904 643,896 652,895 663,897 671,903 674,912 671,921 662,927 646,928 633,922">
          <p>...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="297,1069 306,1044 335,1022 460,1021 472,1028 484,1067 483,1105 473,1129 445,1150 417,1158 344,1155 325,1147 303,1105">
          <p>I guess you're preparing the ingredients for tomorrow's potion challenge?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="509,1091 514,1074 528,1060 560,1054 596,1055 628,1063 642,1072 648,1089 645,1108 629,1124 597,1131 552,1126 519,1116 509,1098">
          <p>...a potion challenge?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="524,1165 529,1154 559,1139 605,1143 643,1143 667,1140 678,1151 679,1166 659,1183 587,1184 551,1187 527,1176">
          <p>...tomorrow?</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="191,257 196,239 216,226 282,223 336,226 357,231 368,243 373,257 369,272 342,288 304,297 263,301 238,300 208,289 193,272">
          <p>Heuu, désolée je vais en prendre que quatre finalement</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="816,15 896,14 899,28 880,45 843,44 825,35 816,25">
          <p>Grrr...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="373,340 563,341 570,356 562,393 565,412 568,425 555,456 533,463 505,469 457,463 423,467 397,464 379,449 370,430 380,389 367,357">
          <p>Bonjour cher marchand, s'il vous plait deux dizaines de chaque. Qualité premium, comme d'habitude.</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="378,568 387,543 409,524 449,512 494,510 532,524 549,541 558,562 556,584 537,603 452,606 428,601 405,601 387,590">
          <p>C'est toujours un plaisir de vous servir Mademoiselle Safran</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="458,688 462,673 474,658 524,653 567,657 590,673 599,693 591,710 573,718 484,719 466,707">
          <p>Hè, mais regardez moi ça, c'est Pepper</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="429,789 440,751 453,732 488,723 574,724 606,741 628,767 633,789 618,815 565,848 531,857 475,843 440,820 429,803">
          <p>Dis donc ; je vois que les affaires marchent bien à la campagne?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="625,912 628,904 643,896 652,895 663,897 671,903 674,912 671,921 662,927 646,928 633,922">
          <p>...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="297,1069 306,1044 335,1022 460,1021 472,1028 484,1067 483,1105 473,1129 445,1150 417,1158 344,1155 325,1147 303,1105">
          <p>J'imagine que tu prépares déjà tes ingrédients pour le concours de potions de demain?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="509,1091 514,1074 528,1060 560,1054 596,1055 628,1063 642,1072 648,1089 645,1108 629,1124 597,1131 552,1126 519,1116 509,1098">
          <p>...un concours de potions?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="524,1165 529,1154 559,1139 605,1143 643,1143 667,1140 678,1151 679,1166 659,1183 587,1184 551,1187 527,1176">
          <p>...demain?</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="191,257 196,239 216,226 282,223 336,226 357,231 368,243 373,257 369,272 342,288 304,297 263,301 238,300 208,289 193,272">
          <p>Oh, prepáčte, môžem vziať iba štyri...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="816,15 896,14 899,28 880,45 843,44 825,35 816,25">
          <p>Hmm...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="373,340 563,341 570,356 562,393 565,412 568,425 555,456 533,463 505,469 457,463 423,467 397,464 379,449 370,430 380,389 367,357">
          <p>Zdravím, dobrý pane. Pripravte prosím pre mňa dva tucty zo všetkého. Prémiovej kvality, ako obyčajne.</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="378,568 387,543 409,524 449,512 494,510 532,524 549,541 558,562 556,584 537,603 452,606 428,601 405,601 387,590">
          <p>Je mi vždy cťou Vám poslúžiť, slečna Saffron</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="458,688 462,673 474,658 524,653 567,657 590,673 599,693 591,710 573,718 484,719 466,707">
          <p>Pozrime sa, to je Pepper</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="429,789 440,751 453,732 488,723 574,724 606,741 628,767 633,789 618,815 565,848 531,857 475,843 440,820 429,803">
          <p>Nechaj ma hádať. Obchodu sa veľmi dobre nedarí na vidieku?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="625,912 628,904 643,896 652,895 663,897 671,903 674,912 671,921 662,927 646,928 633,922">
          <p>...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="297,1069 306,1044 335,1022 460,1021 472,1028 484,1067 483,1105 473,1129 445,1150 417,1158 344,1155 325,1147 303,1105">
          <p>Tipujem, že zháňaš prísady na zajtrajšiu súťaž o najlepší elixír. Že áno?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="509,1091 514,1074 528,1060 560,1054 596,1055 628,1063 642,1072 648,1089 645,1108 629,1124 597,1131 552,1126 519,1116 509,1098">
          <p>...súťaž o najlepší elixír?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="524,1165 529,1154 559,1139 605,1143 643,1143 667,1140 678,1151 679,1166 659,1183 587,1184 551,1187 527,1176">
          <p>...zajtra?</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="40,11 954,11 954,313 39,314"/>
      <frame points="38,337 954,338 953,612 39,613"/>
      <frame points="39,636 954,637 955,993 39,994"/>
      <frame points="39,1017 492,1017 491,1238 39,1238"/>
      <frame points="502,1017 954,1017 954,1238 500,1237"/>
