    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E04P03.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="41,94 41,43 53,20 63,15 210,16 229,33 236,56 225,96 192,122 152,128 90,126 73,125">
          <p>Awww, Carrot! you sweet kitty cat you've come all by yourself</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="423,88 412,53 424,15 594,16 607,30 614,66 595,100 500,110 444,103">
          <p>At the very moment when I need my favorite assistant</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="164,383 151,350 158,324 183,303 314,304 332,352 325,380 261,396 188,393">
          <p>Here, I present you my final masterpiece</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="792,770 775,741 772,706 793,690 907,695 918,713 919,753 891,773">
          <p>the potion of Genius</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="242,979 208,962 198,939 209,916 309,913 321,932 312,960 279,976">
          <p>Do please take a sip</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="696,1033 669,998 684,953 842,953 880,972 881,1016 846,1036 780,1036">
          <p>If it works, you should have a stroke of a genius</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="41,94 41,43 53,20 63,15 210,16 229,33 236,56 225,96 192,122 152,128 90,126 73,125">
          <p>ooooh, Carotte! t'es trop minou d'être venu tout seul</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="423,88 412,53 424,15 594,16 607,30 614,66 595,100 500,110 444,103">
          <p>Pil poil au moment ou j'ai besoin de mon assistant préféré</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="164,383 151,350 158,324 183,303 314,304 332,352 325,380 261,396 188,393">
          <p>Taaadaaaa! Je te présente mon chef-d'oeuvre</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="792,770 775,741 772,706 793,690 907,695 918,713 919,753 891,773">
          <p>la potion des Génies</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="242,979 208,962 198,939 209,916 309,913 321,932 312,960 279,976">
          <p>juste une petite gorgée ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="696,1033 669,998 684,953 842,953 880,972 881,1016 846,1036 780,1036">
          <p>.. et tu devrais être frappé d'un éclair de génie</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="41,94 41,43 53,20 63,15 210,16 229,33 236,56 225,96 192,122 152,128 90,126 73,125">
          <p>Aaa, Carrot! Ty moje zlatíčko, prišiel si sám od seba</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="423,88 412,53 424,15 594,16 607,30 614,66 595,100 500,110 444,103">
          <p>A práve včas keď potrebujem svojho obľúbeného pomocníka</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="164,383 151,350 158,324 183,303 314,304 332,352 325,380 261,396 188,393">
          <p>Toto je moje majstrovské dielo</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="792,770 775,741 772,706 793,690 907,695 918,713 919,753 891,773">
          <p>elixír génia</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="242,979 208,962 198,939 209,916 309,913 321,932 312,960 279,976">
          <p>Odpi si kúsok prosím</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="696,1033 669,998 684,953 842,953 880,972 881,1016 846,1036 780,1036">
          <p>Ak to bude fungovať, mal by si dostať geniálny nápad</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
