        </text-area>
        <text-area points="296,719 716,719 716,764 296,764" bgcolor="#d6d2b5">
          <p>License: Creative Commons Attribution to 'David Revoy' you can do derivations, modifications, repost, sell-it, etc...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="252,768 753,768 753,818 250,818" bgcolor="#d6d2b5">
          <p>Open-source: high resolution layered source files for printing, with fonts available to download, sell, modify, translate, etc...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="263,820 735,820 735,866 266,866" bgcolor="#d5d0b2">
          <p>Tools: This episode was made with 100% free and open-source tools Krita, Gmic, Blender, Gimp on Ubuntu Gnome (GNU/Linux)</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="742,584 847,621 843,642 735,607" text-rotation="342" bgcolor="#d4d3b7">
          <p>Thank you!</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="102,21 898,21 898,85 105,85" bgcolor="#c3bda3">
          <p>Pepper&amp;Carrot est entièrement gratuit, open-source, et sponsorisé grâce au mécénat des lecteurs, pour cet épisode, merci aux 156 Mécènes:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="405,607 584,607 584,631 405,631" bgcolor="#dcd9ba">
