    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E05P05.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="112,19 897,19 897,87 111,87" bgcolor="#d4d6e2">
          <p>Pepper&amp;Carrot is totally free, open-source, and sponsored thanks to the help of patrons. This episode was sponsored by 170 patrons:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="419,647 595,647 595,671 418,671" bgcolor="#f8f3ed">
          <p>Support the project,</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="231,669 789,669 789,696 231,696" bgcolor="#f8f3ed">
          <p>a single dollar donation per webcomic can help Pepper&amp;Carrot a lot!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="314,731 719,731 719,775 315,775" bgcolor="#f8f3ed">
          <p>License: Creative Commons Attribution to 'David Revoy' you can do derivations, modifications, repost, sell-it, etc...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="262,778 766,778 766,823 265,823" bgcolor="#f8f3ed">
          <p>Open-source: high resolution layered source files for printing, with fonts available to download, sell, modify, translate, etc...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="262,824 750,824 750,869 271,869" bgcolor="#f8f3ed">
          <p>Tools: This episode was made with 100% free and open-source tools Krita, Gmic, Blender, Gimp on Ubuntu Gnome (GNU/Linux)</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="112,19 897,19 897,87 111,87" bgcolor="#d4d6e2">
          <p>Pepper&amp;Carrot est entièrement gratuit, open-source, et sponsorisé grâce au mécénat des lecteurs, pour cet épisode, merci aux 156 Mécènes:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="419,647 595,647 595,671 418,671" bgcolor="#f8f3ed">
          <p>Vous aussi,</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="231,669 789,669 789,696 231,696" bgcolor="#f8f3ed">
          <p>devenez mécène de Pepper&amp;Carrot pour le prochain épisode:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="314,731 719,731 719,775 315,775" bgcolor="#f8f3ed">
          <p>License: Creative Commons Attribution à 'David Revoy' vous pouvez modifier, repartager, vendre, etc...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="262,778 766,778 766,823 265,823" bgcolor="#f8f3ed">
          <p>Open-source: toutes les sources, polices d'écritures, fichiers avec calques sont disponibles sur le site officiel au téléchargement.</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="262,824 750,824 750,869 271,869" bgcolor="#f8f3ed">
          <p>Tools: Cet épisode a été dessiné a 100% avec des logiciels libres Krita, Gmic, Blender, Gmic sur Ubuntu Gnome (Gnu/Linux)</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="112,19 897,19 897,87 111,87" bgcolor="#d4d6e2">
          <p>Komiks Pepper&amp;Carrot je úplne zdarma, open-source, a sponzorovaný vďaka pomoci fanúšikov. Táto epizóda bola sponzorovaná 170 fanúšikmi:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="419,647 595,647 595,671 418,671" bgcolor="#f8f3ed">
          <p>Podporte projekt,</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="231,669 789,669 789,696 231,696" bgcolor="#f8f3ed">
          <p>každé darované euro na jeden komis môže veľmi pomôcť Pepper&amp;Carrot!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="314,731 719,731 719,775 315,775" bgcolor="#f8f3ed">
          <p>Licencia: Creative Commons Attribution to 'David Revoy' je dovolené robiť derivácie, modifikácie, kópie, predaj, atď...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="262,778 766,778 766,823 265,823" bgcolor="#f8f3ed">
          <p>Open-source: zdrojové súbory vo vysokom rozlíšení na tlač, s fontami sú k dispozícii na stiahnutie, predaj, modifikáciu, preklady, atď...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="262,824 750,824 750,869 271,869" bgcolor="#f8f3ed">
          <p>Nástroje: Táto epizóda bola vytvorená so 100% slobodnými a open-source nástrojmi Krita, Gmic, Blender, Gimp na Ubuntu Gnome (GNU/Linux)</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
