    <page>
      <title lang="fr">Episode 6: Le concours de potion</title>
      <title lang="sk">Epizóda 6: Súťaž o najlepší elixír</title>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E06.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="146,647 151,630 160,622 173,615 821,615 839,624 847,637 849,650 843,666 834,676 819,682 171,682 158,674 148,662" bgcolor="#a16f58" type="heading" inverted="True">
          <p>Episode 6: The Potion Contest</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="146,647 151,630 160,622 173,615 821,615 839,624 847,637 849,650 843,666 834,676 819,682 171,682 158,674 148,662" bgcolor="#a16f58" type="heading" inverted="True">
          <p>Episode 6: Le concours de potion</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="146,647 151,630 160,622 173,615 821,615 839,624 847,637 849,650 843,666 834,676 819,682 171,682 158,674 148,662" bgcolor="#a16f58" type="heading" inverted="True">
          <p>Epizóda 6: Súťaž o najlepší elixír</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <title lang="en">Episode 6: The Potion Contest</title></page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E06P01.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="42,416 42,349 64,338 209,337 236,355 243,388 222,417 180,428 119,428 68,424">
          <p>Oh shoot, I fell asleep with the window open, again...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="102,514 132,495 222,496 258,511 260,527 239,543 155,550 107,538">
          <p>... it's so windy ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="108,676 121,639 173,618 288,625 318,648 306,695 252,714 159,710 120,694">
          <p>... and why can I see Komona through the window?</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="335,858 334,845 342,833 383,829 418,835 427,844 423,862 373,869 343,865">
          <p>KOMONA!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="458,825 576,824 584,844 572,869 515,873 467,871 455,848">
          <p>The Potion Contest!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="626,864 630,839 640,824 772,824 797,837 806,862 797,898 715,903 648,896 630,882">
          <p>I must've... must've accidentally fallen asleep!*</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="754,1066 952,1066 952,1080 754,1080">
          <p>*See Episode 4: Stroke of Genius</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="469,1118 477,1105 502,1095 539,1096 558,1105 566,1118 561,1132 536,1143 507,1143 483,1136 471,1127">
          <p>... but?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="628,1136 631,1109 644,1096 710,1096 732,1105 743,1130 722,1160 673,1170 643,1156">
          <p>Where am I?!?</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="42,416 42,349 64,338 209,337 236,355 243,388 222,417 180,428 119,428 68,424">
          <p>Oh zut, je me suis encore couchée sans fermer la fenêtre...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="102,514 132,495 222,496 258,511 260,527 239,543 155,550 107,538">
          <p>... mais quel vent!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="108,676 121,639 173,618 288,625 318,648 306,695 252,714 159,710 120,694">
          <p>... et pourquoi je vois Komona par la fenêtre?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="335,858 334,845 342,833 383,829 418,835 427,844 423,862 373,869 343,865">
          <p>KOMONA!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="458,825 576,824 584,844 572,869 515,873 467,871 455,848">
          <p>Le concours de Potion!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="626,864 630,839 640,824 772,824 797,837 806,862 797,898 715,903 648,896 630,882">
          <p>J'ai... J'ai dû m'endormir sans le faire exprès!*</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="754,1066 952,1066 952,1080 754,1080">
          <p>*voir episode 4: Coup de génie</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="469,1118 477,1105 502,1095 539,1096 558,1105 566,1118 561,1132 536,1143 507,1143 483,1136 471,1127">
          <p>... mais?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="628,1136 631,1109 644,1096 710,1096 732,1105 743,1130 722,1160 673,1170 643,1156">
          <p>Où je suis là?!?</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="42,416 42,349 64,338 209,337 236,355 243,388 222,417 180,428 119,428 68,424">
          <p>Do pekla, zaspala som znova pri otvorenom okne...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="102,514 132,495 222,496 258,511 260,527 239,543 155,550 107,538">
          <p>... je taký vietor ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="108,676 121,639 173,618 288,625 318,648 306,695 252,714 159,710 120,694">
          <p>... a ako to, že vidím cez okno Komonu?</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="335,858 334,845 342,833 383,829 418,835 427,844 423,862 373,869 343,865">
          <p>KOMONA!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="458,825 576,824 584,844 572,869 515,873 467,871 455,848">
          <p>Súťaž o najlepší elixír!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="626,864 630,839 640,824 772,824 797,837 806,862 797,898 715,903 648,896 630,882">
          <p>Musela som... musela som nečakane zaspať!*</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="754,1066 952,1066 952,1080 754,1080">
          <p>*pozri epizódu 4: Geniálny nápad</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="469,1118 477,1105 502,1095 539,1096 558,1105 566,1118 561,1132 536,1143 507,1143 483,1136 471,1127">
          <p>... ale?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="628,1136 631,1109 644,1096 710,1096 732,1105 743,1130 722,1160 673,1170 643,1156">
          <p>Kde som to?!?</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="38,81 40,25 260,7 720,39 956,105 956,800 36,800"/>
      <frame points="38,818 956,817 957,1081 39,1081"/>
      <frame points="36,1086 955,1089 956,1336 38,1335"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E06P02.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="262,275 259,245 272,231 317,231 319,269 298,283 272,283">
          <p>!!!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="267,721 288,689 495,689 490,800 381,806 311,797 283,776 269,739">
          <p>Carrot! You're so cute to have thought of bringing me to the Contest!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="605,987 610,971 656,954 724,965 779,961 795,978 778,1003 676,1006 635,1007">
          <p>Fan-tas-tic!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="690,1103 698,1060 724,1042 899,1043 917,1056 925,1107 902,1142 776,1151 718,1143 692,1104">
          <p>You even thought of bringing a potion, my clothes, and my hat...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="722,1245 720,1222 749,1198 809,1187 892,1201 919,1215 917,1245 901,1268 781,1276 737,1265">
          <p>... let's see which potion you brought...</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="262,275 259,245 272,231 317,231 319,269 298,283 272,283">
          <p>!!!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="267,721 288,689 495,689 490,800 381,806 311,797 283,776 269,739">
          <p>Carotte! T'es trop mignon d'avoir pensé à m'emmener au concours!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="605,987 610,971 656,954 724,965 779,961 795,978 778,1003 676,1006 635,1007">
          <p>Ma-gni-fi-que!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="690,1103 698,1060 724,1042 899,1043 917,1056 925,1107 902,1142 776,1151 718,1143 692,1104">
          <p>Tu as même pensé à prendre une potion, mes vêtements, et mon chapeau...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="722,1245 720,1222 749,1198 809,1187 892,1201 919,1215 917,1245 901,1268 781,1276 737,1265">
          <p>.. voyons voir quelle potion tu as pris ...</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="262,275 259,245 272,231 317,231 319,269 298,283 272,283">
          <p>!!!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="267,721 288,689 495,689 490,800 381,806 311,797 283,776 269,739">
          <p>Carrot! Ty si taký zlatý, že si vymyslel ako ma dostať na súťaž!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="605,987 610,971 656,954 724,965 779,961 795,978 778,1003 676,1006 635,1007">
          <p>Fan-tas-tic-ké!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="690,1103 698,1060 724,1042 899,1043 917,1056 925,1107 902,1142 776,1151 718,1143 692,1104">
          <p>Myslel si dokonca na to, ako vziať aj môj elixír, moje šaty a môj klobúk...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="722,1245 720,1222 749,1198 809,1187 892,1201 919,1215 917,1245 901,1268 781,1276 737,1265">
          <p>... pozrime sa, čo za elixír si vzal ...</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="36,194 266,165 313,113 477,70 613,82 648,143 744,149 954,191 956,664 34,665"/>
      <frame points="38,682 492,683 492,911 39,912"/>
      <frame points="500,684 955,684 956,912 502,912"/>
      <frame points="37,932 956,931 956,1335 39,1335"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E06P03.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="232,312 439,312 439,373 234,373">
          <p>WHAT?!!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="145,795 156,760 187,739 269,735 332,737 373,753 395,774 391,802 360,836 286,848 208,846 161,824">
          <p>As Mayor of Komona, I declare the potion contest... Open!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="67,951 84,912 114,893 287,897 352,902 373,915 382,962 364,998 330,1015 161,1016 108,1005 74,969">
          <p>Our town is delighted to welcome no fewer than four witches for this first edition</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="209,1135 202,1066 234,1051 364,1052 410,1070 413,1124 404,1139 239,1140">
          <p>Please give a <strong>huge</strong> round of applause:</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="232,312 439,312 439,373 234,373">
          <p>QUOI?!!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="145,795 156,760 187,739 269,735 332,737 373,753 395,774 391,802 360,836 286,848 208,846 161,824">
          <p>Je déclare, en tant que Maire de Komona, le concours de potion ouvert!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="67,951 84,912 114,893 287,897 352,902 373,915 382,962 364,998 330,1015 161,1016 108,1005 74,969">
          <p>Notre ville est très contente d'accueillir pas moins de quatre sorcières pour cette première.</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="209,1135 202,1066 234,1051 364,1052 410,1070 413,1124 404,1139 239,1140">
          <p>Merci d'applaudir <strong>bien fort:</strong></p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="232,312 439,312 439,373 234,373">
          <p>ČOŽE?!!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="145,795 156,760 187,739 269,735 332,737 373,753 395,774 391,802 360,836 286,848 208,846 161,824">
          <p>Ako starosta Komony, vyhlasujem súťaž o najlepší elixír za... otvorenú!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="67,951 84,912 114,893 287,897 352,902 373,915 382,962 364,998 330,1015 161,1016 108,1005 74,969">
          <p>Naše mesto je poctené privítať nie menej ako štyri čarodejnice na prvom ročníku súťaže</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="209,1135 202,1066 234,1051 364,1052 410,1070 413,1124 404,1139 239,1140">
          <p>Prosím vytvorte <strong>obrovský</strong> aplauz</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="54,29 80,20 321,15 483,11 702,12 876,13 956,17 957,95 943,174 935,215 804,226 402,228 88,226 46,209 43,152"/>
      <frame points="39,245 955,244 955,622 40,623"/>
      <frame points="39,649 149,644 932,645 953,669 954,917 376,917 351,902 242,893 117,891 90,906 81,915 38,915"/>
