    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E06P04.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="42,118 40,20 316,20 301,97 275,117">
          <p>All the way from the great Technologist's Union, it's an honor to welcome the ravishing and ingenious</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="91,122 231,121 231,151 91,151">
          <p><strong>Coriander!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="317,116 336,20 488,20 484,110 476,116">
          <p>... not to forget our local girl, Komona's very own witch</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="345,120 464,120 464,150 345,150">
          <p><strong>Saffron!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="503,95 502,21 682,21 695,97 678,118 517,116">
          <p>... Our third participant comes to us from the lands of the setting moons,</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="540,119 658,120 658,151 540,151">
          <p><strong>Shichimi!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="716,99 710,16 952,16 948,96 914,117 743,119">
          <p>... and finally, our last participant, from the forest of Squirrel's End,</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="784,121 890,121 890,152 782,152">
          <p><strong>Pepper!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="93,681 75,654 74,626 83,616 238,616 248,644 229,678 159,693">
          <p>Let the games begin!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="250,714 256,694 279,683 375,681 425,689 440,710 428,736 394,747 331,751 281,747 255,728">
          <p>The vote will be by applaud-o-meter</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="172,895 158,861 177,820 321,820 335,856 329,893 262,906 198,905">
          <p>First up, Coriander's demonstration</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="259,998 247,974 261,953 312,936 365,947 389,968 385,998 372,1010 336,1019 292,1012">
          <p>Ladies &amp; Gentlemen ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="385,862 380,819 580,817 581,861 562,878 492,883 408,876">
          <p>... fear death no more, thanks to my ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="657,880 649,862 657,839 702,820 820,820 865,840 877,854 875,878 840,903 778,911 702,900">
          <p>... Potion of <strong>ZOMBIFICATION!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="42,118 40,20 316,20 301,97 275,117">
          <p>Venue du grand pays de l'Union des Technologistes, c'est un honneur d'accueillir la ravissante et ingénieuse</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="91,122 231,121 231,151 91,151">
          <p><strong>Coriandre!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="317,116 336,20 488,20 484,110 476,116">
          <p>... sans oublier notre fille du pays, la sorcière elle même de Komona</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="345,120 464,120 464,150 345,150">
          <p><strong>Safran!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="503,95 502,21 682,21 695,97 678,118 517,116">
          <p>... notre troisième participante nous vient du pays des lunes couchantes</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="540,119 658,120 658,151 540,151">
          <p><strong>Shichimi!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="716,99 710,16 952,16 948,96 914,117 743,119">
          <p>... enfin, notre dernière participante qui nous vient de la forêt de</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="784,121 890,121 890,152 782,152">
          <p><strong>Pepper!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="93,681 75,654 74,626 83,616 238,616 248,644 229,678 159,693">
          <p>Que le concours commence!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="250,714 256,694 279,683 375,681 425,689 440,710 428,736 394,747 331,751 281,747 255,728">
          <p>Le vote se fera à l'applaudimètre!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="172,895 158,861 177,820 321,820 335,856 329,893 262,906 198,905">
          <p>Et tout d'abord, place à la démonstration de Coriandre</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="259,998 247,974 261,953 312,936 365,947 389,968 385,998 372,1010 336,1019 292,1012">
          <p>Mesdames et Messieurs...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="385,862 380,819 580,817 581,861 562,878 492,883 408,876">
          <p>... plus besoin d'avoir peur de la mort grâce à ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="657,880 649,862 657,839 702,820 820,820 865,840 877,854 875,878 840,903 778,911 702,900">
          <p>.. ma Potion de <strong>ZOMBIFICATION!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="42,118 40,20 316,20 301,97 275,117">
          <p>Až z ďalekej technologickej únie, je mi cťou privítať okúzlujúcu a vynaliezavú</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="91,122 231,121 231,151 91,151">
          <p><strong>Coriander!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="317,116 336,20 488,20 484,110 476,116">
          <p>... nezabúdajúc na naše miestne dievča, našu Komonskú čarodejnicu</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="345,120 464,120 464,150 345,150">
          <p><strong>Saffron!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="503,95 502,21 682,21 695,97 678,118 517,116">
          <p>... Tretia účastníčka k nám prichádza z krajiny zapadajúceho mesiaca,</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="540,119 658,120 658,151 540,151">
          <p><strong>Shichimi!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="716,99 710,16 952,16 948,96 914,117 743,119">
          <p>... a napokon, naša posledná účastníčka, z lesa na veveričom konci,</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="784,121 890,121 890,152 782,152">
          <p><strong>Pepper!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="93,681 75,654 74,626 83,616 238,616 248,644 229,678 159,693">
          <p>Nech zvíťazí najlepšia!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="250,714 256,694 279,683 375,681 425,689 440,710 428,736 394,747 331,751 281,747 255,728">
          <p>O víťazke rozhodne merač aplauzu</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="172,895 158,861 177,820 321,820 335,856 329,893 262,906 198,905">
          <p>Prvá je na rade Corianderina ukážka</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="259,998 247,974 261,953 312,936 365,947 389,968 385,998 372,1010 336,1019 292,1012">
          <p>Dámi a páni ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="385,862 380,819 580,817 581,861 562,878 492,883 408,876">
          <p>... už sa nemusíte báť smrti, vďaka môjmu ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="657,880 649,862 657,839 702,820 820,820 865,840 877,854 875,878 840,903 778,911 702,900">
          <p>... elixíru <strong>ZOMBIFIKÁCIE!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="39,591 39,16 326,15 220,593"/>
      <frame points="228,591 330,15 492,17 493,591"/>
      <frame points="501,591 501,15 684,17 788,590"/>
      <frame points="796,591 692,17 958,19 957,591"/>
      <frame points="38,610 956,610 957,795 39,797"/>
      <frame points="39,815 372,815 375,946 386,962 390,977 387,996 381,1006 375,1014 374,1335 38,1337"/>
      <frame points="379,815 583,814 583,870 581,1336 381,1337"/>
      <frame points="589,816 956,814 956,1334 745,1335 737,1345 729,1343 723,1334 588,1335"/>
