    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E06P05.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="46,41 46,13 203,13 198,42">
          <p><strong>FANTASTIC!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="131,70 145,43 364,43 380,69 366,105 324,124 245,128 160,113 137,95">
          <p>Coriander defies death itself with this mi-ra-cu-lous potion!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="92,296 84,264 97,232 290,232 300,260 290,299 268,305 232,313 162,315 112,310">
          <p>... but please, save your applause, people of Komona!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="259,362 237,314 297,299 389,310 389,346 363,356 280,356">
          <p>because here is <emphasis>MY</emphasis> Potion</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="925,438 909,452 798,459 728,460 694,448 677,400 689,362 718,349 842,343 910,350 927,365 937,403">
          <p>The real potion you've all been waiting for: the one which will amaze your neighbors ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="807,462 926,453 943,463 946,493 937,511 817,510 801,488">
          <p>... <emphasis>make them jealous!</emphasis></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="226,633 196,608 192,571 228,540 489,542 511,571 508,609 480,632 391,641">
          <p>... all this is possible with the simple application of a single drop of my ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="623,605 609,561 644,542 871,543 870,585 865,615 716,612">
          <p>... Potion of <strong>POSHNESS!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="42,1164 44,1084 287,1081 277,1117 257,1121 260,1147 226,1172 147,1181 75,1179">
          <p>Fantastic! Incredible! This potion could make all of Komona rich!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="329,1321 308,1292 311,1251 346,1230 431,1227 506,1235 534,1255 537,1290 505,1329 456,1334 345,1332">
          <p>Your applause can't be wrong. Coriander has already been eliminated</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="46,41 46,13 203,13 198,42">
          <p><strong>FANTASTIQUE!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="131,70 145,43 364,43 380,69 366,105 324,124 245,128 160,113 137,95">
          <p>Coriandre défie la mort elle-même avec cette potion mi-ra-cu-leu-se!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="92,296 84,264 97,232 290,232 300,260 290,299 268,305 232,313 162,315 112,310">
          <p>... mais enfin, gardez vos applaudissements, peuple de Komona!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="259,362 237,314 297,299 389,310 389,346 363,356 280,356">
          <p>car voici <emphasis>MA</emphasis> Potion</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="925,438 909,452 798,459 728,460 694,448 677,400 689,362 718,349 842,343 910,350 927,365 937,403">
          <p>La vraie potion que vous attendez tous: celle qui peut impressionner tous vos voisins ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="807,462 926,453 943,463 946,493 937,511 817,510 801,488">
          <p><emphasis>... les rendre jaloux!</emphasis></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="226,633 196,608 192,571 228,540 489,542 511,571 508,609 480,632 391,641">
          <p>... tout ceci est désormais possible par l'application d'une simple goutte de ma ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="623,605 609,561 644,542 871,543 870,585 865,615 716,612">
          <p>... potion de <strong>BOURGEOISIE!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="42,1164 44,1084 287,1081 277,1117 257,1121 260,1147 226,1172 147,1181 75,1179">
          <p>Fantastique! Incroyable! cette potion pourrait rendre le tout Komona riche!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="329,1321 308,1292 311,1251 346,1230 431,1227 506,1235 534,1255 537,1290 505,1329 456,1334 345,1332">
          <p>Vos applaudissements ne s'y trompent pas; Coriandre est déjà éliminée.</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="46,41 46,13 203,13 198,42">
          <p><strong>FANTASTICKÉ!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="131,70 145,43 364,43 380,69 366,105 324,124 245,128 160,113 137,95">
          <p>Coriander poráža samotnú smrť so svojim zázračným elixírom!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="92,296 84,264 97,232 290,232 300,260 290,299 268,305 232,313 162,315 112,310">
          <p>... ale pozor, šetrite si aplauz, ľudia Komony!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="259,362 237,314 297,299 389,310 389,346 363,356 280,356">
          <p>pretože je tu <emphasis>MÔJ </emphasis> elixír</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="925,438 909,452 798,459 728,460 694,448 677,400 689,362 718,349 842,343 910,350 927,365 937,403">
          <p>Skutočný elixír, na ktorý ste všetci čakali: ten, ktorý nechá v úžase všetkých vašich susedov ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="807,462 926,453 943,463 946,493 937,511 817,510 801,488">
          <p>... <emphasis>vyblednú závisťou!</emphasis></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="226,633 196,608 192,571 228,540 489,542 511,571 508,609 480,632 391,641">
          <p>... toto všetko je možné použitím len jedinej kvapky môjho ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="623,605 609,561 644,542 871,543 870,585 865,615 716,612">
          <p>... elixíru <strong>VZNEŠENOSTI!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="42,1164 44,1084 287,1081 277,1117 257,1121 260,1147 226,1172 147,1181 75,1179">
          <p>Fantastické! Neuveriteľné! Tento elixír urobí všetkých z Komony bohatých!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="329,1321 308,1292 311,1251 346,1230 431,1227 506,1235 534,1255 537,1290 505,1329 456,1334 345,1332">
          <p>Sila vášho aplauzu sa nemôže mýliť. Coriander bola týmto vyradená</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="40,54 41,11 240,11 955,12 954,206 40,206 39,152 35,142 35,121 40,111"/>
      <frame points="40,228 954,228 955,514 39,515"/>
      <frame points="40,536 539,537 540,1051 38,1053"/>
      <frame points="550,537 953,536 955,970 965,967 971,977 969,1000 959,1013 959,1033 955,1038 956,1053 933,1053 911,1067 905,1062 904,1052 889,1052 876,1065 869,1061 846,1074 838,1074 834,1062 836,1053 799,1052 789,1058 785,1058 780,1053 724,1053 704,1065 694,1061 692,1053 655,1052 646,1060 636,1057 627,1059 627,1055 599,1069 592,1063 592,1053 569,1052 558,1062 549,1062 545,1052 545,1014 549,1005"/>
      <frame points="37,1075 953,1074 954,1335 930,1335 931,1341 896,1358 761,1356 565,1355 509,1350 505,1337 308,1334 294,1345 272,1347 270,1341 228,1364 115,1364 40,1366 34,1360 33,1336 36,1326 39,1320"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E06P06.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="103,88 94,51 105,14 340,14 357,40 359,75 338,99 298,109 194,110 121,99">
          <p>That last demonstration would now seem difficult to beat for Shichimi!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="43,378 45,326 66,308 110,299 165,304 184,318 190,369 181,393 153,408 70,405">
          <p>I... I did not know we had to give a demonstration</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="425,113 417,84 421,52 448,31 494,18 536,24 572,43 583,73 574,112 546,134 496,138 449,129">
          <p>... come on Shichimi, everyone's waiting for you</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="420,337 425,309 487,311 490,337">
          <p><strong>NO!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="393,371 411,348 497,340 556,351 581,372 571,403 530,407 415,404 399,390">
          <p>I cannot, it is too dangerous</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="429,410 530,410 539,438 436,436">
          <p><strong>SORRY!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="703,56 710,28 725,15 927,16 944,31 947,68 923,93 864,109 765,104 721,91">
          <p>It seems, Ladies &amp; Gentlemen that Shichimi forfeits...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="89,572 98,541 148,533 200,543 203,573 182,600 139,606 99,591">
          <p>Give me that!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="282,598 282,535 314,516 378,508 463,513 488,529 496,582 474,617 427,633 324,624 292,614">
          <p>... and stop pretending to be shy, you're spoiling the show</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="284,810 290,775 309,750 468,742 509,759 526,785 513,828 471,854 412,860 330,857 291,834">
          <p>Everyone already knows that I've won the contest no matter what your potion does ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="877,547 882,514 928,518 929,552 897,557">
          <p>!!!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="736,1025 753,912 950,913 948,1025">
          <p><strong>CAREFUL!!!</strong> It's a potion for <strong>GIANT MONSTERS!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="103,88 94,51 105,14 340,14 357,40 359,75 338,99 298,109 194,110 121,99">
          <p>Cela va être à présent difficile de rivaliser pour Shichimi!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="43,378 45,326 66,308 110,299 165,304 184,318 190,369 181,393 153,408 70,405">
          <p>Je... je ne savais pas qu'il fallait faire une démonstration</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="425,113 417,84 421,52 448,31 494,18 536,24 572,43 583,73 574,112 546,134 496,138 449,129">
          <p>... allons Shichimi, tout le monde vous attend</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="420,337 425,309 487,311 490,337">
          <p><strong>NON!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="393,371 411,348 497,340 556,351 581,372 571,403 530,407 415,404 399,390">
          <p>je ne peux pas, trop dangereux</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="429,410 530,410 539,438 436,436">
          <p><strong>PARDON!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="703,56 710,28 725,15 927,16 944,31 947,68 923,93 864,109 765,104 721,91">
          <p>Il semblerait, Mesdames et Messieurs que Shichimi déclare forfait...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="89,572 98,541 148,533 200,543 203,573 182,600 139,606 99,591">
          <p>Donne moi ça!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="282,598 282,535 314,516 378,508 463,513 488,529 496,582 474,617 427,633 324,624 292,614">
          <p>... et puis arrête de faire ta timide et ne gâche pas le spectacle</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="284,810 290,775 309,750 468,742 509,759 526,785 513,828 471,854 412,860 330,857 291,834">
          <p>Tout le monde sait déjà que j'ai gagné le concours alors quoi que ta potion fasse ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="877,547 882,514 928,518 929,552 897,557">
          <p>!!!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="736,1025 753,912 950,913 948,1025">
          <p><strong>ATTENTION!!!</strong> C'est une potion de <strong>MONSTRE GÉANT!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="103,88 94,51 105,14 340,14 357,40 359,75 338,99 298,109 194,110 121,99">
          <p>Táto posledná ukážka vyzerá byť teraz ťažko prekonateľná pre Shichimi!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="43,378 45,326 66,308 110,299 165,304 184,318 190,369 181,393 153,408 70,405">
          <p>Ja... Ja som netušila, že musíme predviezť ukážku</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="425,113 417,84 421,52 448,31 494,18 536,24 572,43 583,73 574,112 546,134 496,138 449,129">
          <p>... poď Shichimi, každý na teba čaká</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="420,337 425,309 487,311 490,337">
          <p><strong>NIE!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="393,371 411,348 497,340 556,351 581,372 571,403 530,407 415,404 399,390">
          <p>Ja nemôžem, je to príliš nebezpečné</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="429,410 530,410 539,438 436,436">
          <p><strong>PREPÁČTE!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="703,56 710,28 725,15 927,16 944,31 947,68 923,93 864,109 765,104 721,91">
          <p>Vyzerá to, dámi a páni, že Shichimi sa vzdáva...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="89,572 98,541 148,533 200,543 203,573 182,600 139,606 99,591">
          <p>Daj mi to!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="282,598 282,535 314,516 378,508 463,513 488,529 496,582 474,617 427,633 324,624 292,614">
          <p>... a prestaň predstierať ostýchavosť, kazíš nám šou</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="284,810 290,775 309,750 468,742 509,759 526,785 513,828 471,854 412,860 330,857 291,834">
          <p>Každý už vie, že som vyhrala súťaž bez ohľadu na to, čo tvoj elixír urobí ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="877,547 882,514 928,518 929,552 897,557">
          <p>!!!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="736,1025 753,912 950,913 948,1025">
          <p><strong>POZOR!!!</strong> Je to elixír <strong>OBROVSKÝCH MONŠTIER!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="40,11 378,11 379,483 40,483"/>
      <frame points="389,12 681,11 682,483 388,483"/>
      <frame points="692,12 954,11 954,482 692,483"/>
      <frame points="39,504 267,504 268,885 39,886"/>
      <frame points="278,505 954,504 955,886 278,886"/>
      <frame points="39,907 956,907 955,1333 39,1334"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E06P07.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="41,1140 41,1095 155,1095 164,1113 159,1131 71,1140">
          <p>... huh, cool!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="61,1155 68,1143 166,1132 223,1137 245,1153 234,1170 186,1180 81,1171">
          <p>so it's my turn now?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="43,1327 43,1244 92,1225 171,1226 243,1240 273,1270 273,1303 260,1331 44,1330">
          <p>... my potion will at least be worth a few laughs because ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="811,1135 789,1120 788,1101 794,1094 902,1095 911,1117 896,1132 847,1133">
          <p>Run, idiot!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="766,1331 758,1279 791,1265 932,1263 949,1275 949,1331 944,1334 770,1335">
          <p>The competition is over! ... save yourself!</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="41,1140 41,1095 155,1095 164,1113 159,1131 71,1140">
          <p>... heu cool!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="61,1155 68,1143 166,1132 223,1137 245,1153 234,1170 186,1180 81,1171">
          <p>c'est donc à mon tour maintenant?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="43,1327 43,1244 92,1225 171,1226 243,1240 273,1270 273,1303 260,1331 44,1330">
          <p>... ma potion devrait au moins avoir le mérite de vous faire rire car....</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="811,1135 789,1120 788,1101 794,1094 902,1095 911,1117 896,1132 847,1133">
          <p>Fuis idiote!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="766,1331 758,1279 791,1265 932,1263 949,1275 949,1331 944,1334 770,1335">
          <p>le concours est fini! ... sauve ta peau!</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="41,1140 41,1095 155,1095 164,1113 159,1131 71,1140">
          <p>... ha, super!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="61,1155 68,1143 166,1132 223,1137 245,1153 234,1170 186,1180 81,1171">
          <p>takže som ja na rade?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="43,1327 43,1244 92,1225 171,1226 243,1240 273,1270 273,1303 260,1331 44,1330">
          <p>... môj elixír bude prinajmenšom hodný chvíle smiechu pretože ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="811,1135 789,1120 788,1101 794,1094 902,1095 911,1117 896,1132 847,1133">
          <p>Bež, hlupaňa!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="766,1331 758,1279 791,1265 932,1263 949,1275 949,1331 944,1334 770,1335">
          <p>Súťaž skončila! ... zachráň sa kto môžeš!</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="40,11 954,11 954,801 40,801"/>
      <frame points="40,897 55,845 89,839 151,836 283,829 335,820 485,820 592,821 616,829 681,817 809,798 826,795 817,832 828,831 837,842 925,826 958,858 958,1020 944,1049 894,1058 812,1065 628,1070 556,1070 425,1054 352,1068 247,1069 162,1071 111,1054 78,1038 50,991"/>
      <frame points="39,1090 954,1090 954,1333 39,1334"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E06P08.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="190,174 176,159 181,145 224,135 293,137 322,147 332,156 324,176 207,178">
          <p>there you go ...</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="170,247 173,217 200,185 328,180 360,193 383,233 372,263 335,275 246,278 190,265">
          <p>... as usual, everyone leaves just when it's our turn</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="631,382 614,344 619,302 644,277 708,264 784,272 825,294 844,327 835,371 810,393 708,400 653,393">
          <p>At least I have an idea of what we'll be able to do with your "potion", Carrot</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="700,483 684,453 691,422 716,403 814,397 851,410 873,437 868,472 846,490 776,501 712,492">
          <p>...put everything back in order here and head home!</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="95,688 95,649 196,647 194,691">
          <p><strong>HEY!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="307,708 308,674 438,659 530,658 625,677 625,710 601,714 440,719">
          <p>You <strong>Oversized-posh-zombie-canary!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="114,1129 106,1100 131,1085 303,1086 317,1118 301,1140 184,1145">
          <p>Wanna try one last potion? ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="742,1276 741,1249 774,1226 853,1223 885,1242 889,1270 866,1290 769,1292">
          <p>... not really, huh?</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="190,174 176,159 181,145 224,135 293,137 322,147 332,156 324,176 207,178">
          <p>et voilà:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="170,247 173,217 200,185 328,180 360,193 383,233 372,263 335,275 246,278 190,265">
          <p>...comme d'habitude tout le monde part au moment où c'est à nous</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="631,382 614,344 619,302 644,277 708,264 784,272 825,294 844,327 835,371 810,393 708,400 653,393">
          <p>En tout cas j'ai une petite idée de ce que l'on va pouvoir faire avec ta «potion» Carotte</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="700,483 684,453 691,422 716,403 814,397 851,410 873,437 868,472 846,490 776,501 712,492">
          <p>...remettons de l'ordre ici et rentrons!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="95,688 95,649 196,647 194,691">
          <p><strong>HÉ!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="307,708 308,674 438,659 530,658 625,677 625,710 601,714 440,719">
          <p>Toi le <strong>Piou-piou-géant-zombie-bourgeois!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="114,1129 106,1100 131,1085 303,1086 317,1118 301,1140 184,1145">
          <p>Ça te plairait de tester la dernière potion?...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="742,1276 741,1249 774,1226 853,1223 885,1242 889,1270 866,1290 769,1292">
          <p>... pas vraiment hein?</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="190,174 176,159 181,145 224,135 293,137 322,147 332,156 324,176 207,178">
          <p>tak to vidíš...</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="170,247 173,217 200,185 328,180 360,193 383,233 372,263 335,275 246,278 190,265">
          <p>... tak ako vždy, každý odíde hneď ako sme my na rade</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="631,382 614,344 619,302 644,277 708,264 784,272 825,294 844,327 835,371 810,393 708,400 653,393">
          <p>Aspoň že mám nápad ako teraz využiť tvoj "elixír", Carrot</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="700,483 684,453 691,422 716,403 814,397 851,410 873,437 868,472 846,490 776,501 712,492">
          <p>...dáme tu všetko do poriadku a pôjdeme domov!</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="95,688 95,649 196,647 194,691">
          <p><strong>HEJ!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="307,708 308,674 438,659 530,658 625,677 625,710 601,714 440,719">
          <p>ty <strong>obro-vznešeno-zombie-kanárik!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="114,1129 106,1100 131,1085 303,1086 317,1118 301,1140 184,1145">
          <p>Chceš vyskúšat ešte jeden elixír? ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="742,1276 741,1249 774,1226 853,1223 885,1242 889,1270 866,1290 769,1292">
          <p>... naozaj nie, heh?</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="39,11 954,11 954,611 39,611"/>
      <frame points="39,632 954,632 955,1059 40,1059"/>
      <frame points="39,1081 954,1081 954,1334 40,1334"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E06P09.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="103,79 97,57 113,28 164,15 209,21 237,38 246,58 233,85 205,97 159,105 119,97">
          <p>Yeah, read the label, carefully ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="703,229 693,199 707,159 743,140 842,137 923,144 946,159 947,231 906,252 826,259 744,252 710,241">
          <p>... I won't think twice before pouring it all over you if you don't get out of Komona right away!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="42,809 57,785 80,773 249,774 274,789 278,813 273,832 103,854 64,844 47,829">
          <p>Because she saved our town when it was in peril</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="107,859 284,833 324,838 347,858 352,889 333,919 260,934 188,932 131,927 103,906 97,884">
          <p>we award first place to Pepper for her Potion of ...??!!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="649,1147 639,1122 647,1092 691,1078 727,1081 745,1094 750,1118 745,1133 702,1155">
          <p>... Haha! yep ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="709,1158 768,1119 845,1111 908,1118 938,1135 948,1163 948,1225 937,1249 914,1266 820,1281 747,1270 730,1264 705,1230 701,1185">
          <p>... huh ... in fact, it's not really a potion; it's my cat's pee sample from his last trip to the vet!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="835,1321 820,1300 825,1283 925,1268 940,1278 945,1305 929,1320 889,1327">
          <p>... no demo then? ...</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="103,79 97,57 113,28 164,15 209,21 237,38 246,58 233,85 205,97 159,105 119,97">
          <p>Oui, lis bien l'étiquette...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="703,229 693,199 707,159 743,140 842,137 923,144 946,159 947,231 906,252 826,259 744,252 710,241">
          <p>.. je n'hésiterai pas à t'en verser dessus si tu dégages pas tout de suite de Komona!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="42,809 57,785 80,773 249,774 274,789 278,813 273,832 103,854 64,844 47,829">
          <p>Parce qu'elle a sauvé notre ville d'un désastre,</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="107,859 284,833 324,838 347,858 352,889 333,919 260,934 188,932 131,927 103,906 97,884">
          <p>nous remettons la première place à Pepper pour sa Potion de ..??!!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="649,1147 639,1122 647,1092 691,1078 727,1081 745,1094 750,1118 745,1133 702,1155">
          <p>... Haha! oui ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="709,1158 768,1119 845,1111 908,1118 938,1135 948,1163 948,1225 937,1249 914,1266 820,1281 747,1270 730,1264 705,1230 701,1185">
          <p>... heu... en fait, c'est pas vraiment une potion; ce sont les échantillons d'urine de mon chat pour sa visite médicale!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="835,1321 820,1300 825,1283 925,1268 940,1278 945,1305 929,1320 889,1327">
          <p>... pas de démo hein?...</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="103,79 97,57 113,28 164,15 209,21 237,38 246,58 233,85 205,97 159,105 119,97">
          <p>Áno, prečítaj si ten nápis pozorne ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="703,229 693,199 707,159 743,140 842,137 923,144 946,159 947,231 906,252 826,259 744,252 710,241">
          <p>... Nebudem váhať to na teba celé vyliať, ak nevypadneš z Komony hneď teraz!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="42,809 57,785 80,773 249,774 274,789 278,813 273,832 103,854 64,844 47,829">
          <p>Pretože zachránila naše mesto, keď bolo v ohrození</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="107,859 284,833 324,838 347,858 352,889 333,919 260,934 188,932 131,927 103,906 97,884">
          <p>udeľujeme prvé miesto Pepper za jej elixír ...??!!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="649,1147 639,1122 647,1092 691,1078 727,1081 745,1094 750,1118 745,1133 702,1155">
          <p>... Haha! ano ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="709,1158 768,1119 845,1111 908,1118 938,1135 948,1163 948,1225 937,1249 914,1266 820,1281 747,1270 730,1264 705,1230 701,1185">
          <p>... heh ... v skutočnosti, to nie je ozajstný elixír; je to vzorka moču mojho kocúra z jeho poslednej návštevy veterinára!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="835,1321 820,1300 825,1283 925,1268 940,1278 945,1305 929,1320 889,1327">
          <p>... žiadna ukážka teda? ...</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="39,11 954,11 955,283 39,283"/>
      <frame points="40,305 954,304 954,501 40,500"/>
      <frame points="39,523 953,523 954,746 39,746"/>
      <frame points="40,768 953,768 954,1368 603,1367 603,1334 40,1335"/>
    </page>
