    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E07P02.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="702,362 696,339 707,324 733,315 766,316 789,324 801,345 797,360 771,371 718,371">
          <p>Found you!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="46,648 46,553 203,552 227,571 231,607 217,638 193,650 115,655">
          <p>Come on, nap-time is over, time to go home!</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="702,362 696,339 707,324 733,315 766,316 789,324 801,345 797,360 771,371 718,371">
          <p>Ah! Te voilà!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="46,648 46,553 203,552 227,571 231,607 217,638 193,650 115,655">
          <p>Allez, c'est fini le gros dodo, on rentre à la maison!</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="702,362 696,339 707,324 733,315 766,316 789,324 801,345 797,360 771,371 718,371">
          <p>Ha! Tak tu si!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="46,648 46,553 203,552 227,571 231,607 217,638 193,650 115,655">
          <p>Poďme ty spachtoš, čas ísť domov!</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="35,10 954,6 957,265 37,268"/>
      <frame points="36,280 956,282 963,527 31,529"/>
      <frame points="37,541 960,538 961,1079 32,1082"/>
      <frame points="34,1093 959,1093 959,1334 36,1341"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E07P03.webp"/>
      <frame points="42,7 954,10 953,292 43,288"/>
      <frame points="41,305 951,304 954,595 37,595"/>
      <frame points="39,607 957,606 964,1341 32,1339"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E07P04.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="70,127 52,86 53,61 88,47 164,38 221,44 267,67 277,83 267,127 247,137 155,143 89,136">
          <p>Welcome... adventurers, to the magical Fairy Cave...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="697,372 697,355 709,333 742,313 793,304 857,309 907,320 928,335 932,352 930,375 916,393 886,407 833,414 788,412 733,402 704,384">
          <p>... we grant you a single wish, anything you desire and we will make it reality!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="186,557 174,544 175,528 188,511 225,504 293,505 311,518 317,531 313,547 297,558 243,565">
          <p>... anything ... ... I desire</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="350,1134 339,1107 342,1092 376,1065 444,1054 508,1060 547,1071 574,1099 576,1121 568,1137 503,1132 445,1136 416,1153 362,1142">
          <p>I... I'd like to, uh, what I'd like is that ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="430,1152 537,1152 537,1186 428,1186" bgcolor="#ffb381">
          <p><strong>Meow!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="70,127 52,86 53,61 88,47 164,38 221,44 267,67 277,83 267,127 247,137 155,143 89,136">
          <p>Bienvenue... dans la grotte magique des fées, aventuriers...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="697,372 697,355 709,333 742,313 793,304 857,309 907,320 928,335 932,352 930,375 916,393 886,407 833,414 788,412 733,402 704,384">
          <p>...exprimez n'importe quel souhait et nous l'exaucerons!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="186,557 174,544 175,528 188,511 225,504 293,505 311,518 317,531 313,547 297,558 243,565">
          <p>...n'importe... ...lequel</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="350,1134 339,1107 342,1092 376,1065 444,1054 508,1060 547,1071 574,1099 576,1121 568,1137 503,1132 445,1136 416,1153 362,1142">
          <p>Je ... Je souhaiterai, enfin, ce que je veux ce serai</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="430,1152 537,1152 537,1186 428,1186" bgcolor="#ffb381">
          <p><strong>Miaou!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="70,127 52,86 53,61 88,47 164,38 221,44 267,67 277,83 267,127 247,137 155,143 89,136">
          <p>Vitajte... dobrodruhovia, v magickej Čarovnej Jaskyni...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="697,372 697,355 709,333 742,313 793,304 857,309 907,320 928,335 932,352 930,375 916,393 886,407 833,414 788,412 733,402 704,384">
          <p>... udelujeme vám jedno prianie, čokoľvek si želáte spravíme realitou!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="186,557 174,544 175,528 188,511 225,504 293,505 311,518 317,531 313,547 297,558 243,565">
          <p>... čokoľvek ... ... si želám</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="350,1134 339,1107 342,1092 376,1065 444,1054 508,1060 547,1071 574,1099 576,1121 568,1137 503,1132 445,1136 416,1153 362,1142">
          <p>Ja... ja by som, eh, čo by som rada ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="430,1152 537,1152 537,1186 428,1186" bgcolor="#ffb381">
          <p><strong>Mňau!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="37,7 959,7 959,446 37,444"/>
      <frame points="35,457 957,459 960,706 38,712"/>
      <frame points="37,718 957,721 962,977 33,984"/>
      <frame points="36,994 955,994 963,1338 37,1341"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E07P05.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="495,414 500,389 524,371 610,362 676,368 704,383 719,408 716,437 686,458 593,469 535,458 507,437">
          <p>I know that sometimes the best wish for nothing to change...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="593,563 567,542 582,522 748,519 771,554 724,563">
          <p>... but seriously?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="655,672 629,657 621,634 635,607 671,593 742,591 802,597 818,606 825,630 819,655 791,668 726,675">
          <p>"I wish to go back to sleep"? What a waste!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="702,1338 890,1338 890,1365 701,1365">
          <p>Episode 7: The Wish</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="495,414 500,389 524,371 610,362 676,368 704,383 719,408 716,437 686,458 593,469 535,458 507,437">
          <p>Je sais bien que parfois le meilleur des souhaits, c'est que rien ne change...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="593,563 567,542 582,522 748,519 771,554 724,563">
          <p>...mais quand même</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="655,672 629,657 621,634 635,607 671,593 742,591 802,597 818,606 825,630 819,655 791,668 726,675">
          <p>"souhaiter retourner dormir"? Quel gâchis!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="702,1338 890,1338 890,1365 701,1365">
          <p>Episode 7: le souhait</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="495,414 500,389 524,371 610,362 676,368 704,383 719,408 716,437 686,458 593,469 535,458 507,437">
          <p>Ja viem, že niekedy je najlepšie prianie nič nemeniť...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="593,563 567,542 582,522 748,519 771,554 724,563">
          <p>... ale vážne?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="655,672 629,657 621,634 635,607 671,593 742,591 802,597 818,606 825,630 819,655 791,668 726,675">
          <p>"Želám si ísť opäť pospať"? Aké plytvanie!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="702,1338 890,1338 890,1365 701,1365">
          <p>Epizóda 7: Prianie</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="39,17 864,7 958,44 958,1280 924,1331 444,1344 100,1338 31,1287"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E07P06.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="71,5 923,5 923,67 73,67">
          <p>Pepper&amp;Carrot is entirely free, open-source, and sponsored thanks to the kind patronage of readers. For this episode, thank you to the 273 Patrons:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="347,732 660,732 660,779 348,779">
          <p>You too can become a patron of Pepper&amp;Carrot for the next episode:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="350,804 637,804 637,845 350,845">
          <p>License: Creative Commons Attribution You can modify, reshare, sell etc ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="213,846 780,846 780,913 214,913">
          <p>Open-source: all source files with layers and fonts are available on the official site.</p><p>Tools: This episode was 100% drawn with Free/Libre software Krita on Linux Mint</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="71,5 923,5 923,67 73,67">
          <p>Pepper&amp;Carrot est entièrement gratuit, open-source, et sponsorisé grâce au mécénat des lecteurs. Pour cet épisode, merci aux 273 Mécènes:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="347,732 660,732 660,779 348,779">
          <p>Vous aussi, devenez mécène de Pepper&amp;Carrot pour le prochain épisode:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="350,804 637,804 637,845 350,845">
          <p>License : Creative Commons Attribution vous pouvez modifier, repartager, vendre, etc...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="213,846 780,846 780,913 214,913">
          <p>Open-source : toutes les sources, polices d'écritures, fichiers avec calques sont disponibles sur le site officiel au téléchargement.</p><p>Tools : Cet épisode a été dessiné a 100% avec des logiciels libres Krita sur Linux Mint</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="71,5 923,5 923,67 73,67">
          <p>Komiks Pepper&amp;Carrot je úplne zadarmo, open-source, a sponzorovaný vďaka podpore čitateľov. Za túto epizódu patrí vďaka 273 podporovateľom:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="347,732 660,732 660,779 348,779">
          <p>Ty sa tiež môžeš stať podporovateľom Pepper&amp;Carrot pre ďaľšiu epizódu:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="350,804 637,804 637,845 350,845">
          <p>Licencia: Creative Commons Attribution Je možné upravovať, zdieľať, predávať atď ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="213,846 780,846 780,913 214,913">
          <p>Open-source: všetky zdrojové súbory s vrstvami a fontami sú k dispozícii na oficiálnej stránke.</p><p>Nástroje: Táto epizóda bola 100% kreslená pomocou slobodného software-u Krita na operačnom systéme Linux Mint</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page>
