          <p>Episode 8: Pepper's Birthday Party</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="146,647 151,630 160,622 173,615 821,615 839,624 847,637 849,650 843,666 834,676 819,682 171,682 158,674 148,662" bgcolor="#fce78a" type="heading">
          <p>Episode 8: L'anniversaire de Pepper</p>
