    <title lang="en">Episode 8: Pepper's Birthday Party</title></page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E08P01.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="660,696 652,679 661,653 698,632 766,623 837,625 878,632 910,651 920,677 908,701 876,719 813,732 754,731 702,724 671,708">
          <p>It's nearly my birthday and I don't have any friends to celebrate it with.</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="660,696 652,679 661,653 698,632 766,623 837,625 878,632 910,651 920,677 908,701 876,719 813,732 754,731 702,724 671,708">
          <p>C'est bientôt mon anniversaire et j'ai même pas d'amis avec qui fêter ça...</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="660,696 652,679 661,653 698,632 766,623 837,625 878,632 910,651 920,677 908,701 876,719 813,732 754,731 702,724 671,708">
          <p>Blížia sa moje narodeniny a ja nemám žiadnych priateľov, s ktorými by som ich mohla osláviť.</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="35,7 957,5 959,581 35,583"/>
      <frame points="36,597 956,595 956,769 36,770"/>
      <frame points="34,787 955,786 959,949 36,949"/>
      <frame points="37,967 956,966 956,1338 36,1338"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E08P02.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="43,92 43,15 218,15 234,27 245,49 239,77 225,94 159,106 74,103">
          <p>Oh, invite the other witches we met at the Potion Contest? *</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="465,294 457,277 462,261 483,250 557,251 578,263 584,280 581,298 562,306 490,308">
          <p>Great idea Carrot!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="739,355 953,355 953,368 739,368">
          <p>*See Episode 6: The Potion Contest</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="345,592 356,567 424,585 415,611" text-rotation="345" bgcolor="#d6bc7f">
          <p>Invitation</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="43,92 43,15 218,15 234,27 245,49 239,77 225,94 159,106 74,103">
          <p>Oh, inviter les sorcières qu'on a rencontrées au concours de Potion? *</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="465,294 457,277 462,261 483,250 557,251 578,263 584,280 581,298 562,306 490,308">
          <p>Bonne idée Carotte!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="739,355 953,355 953,368 739,368">
          <p>*voir épisode 6: Le concours de potion</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="345,592 356,567 424,585 415,611" text-rotation="345" bgcolor="#d6bc7f">
          <p>Invitation</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="43,92 43,15 218,15 234,27 245,49 239,77 225,94 159,106 74,103">
          <p>Ach, pozveme ostatné čarodejnice, ktoré sme stretli na súťaži o najlepší elixír? *</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="465,294 457,277 462,261 483,250 557,251 578,263 584,280 581,298 562,306 490,308">
          <p>Výborný nápad Carrot!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="739,355 953,355 953,368 739,368">
          <p>*Pozri Epizóda 6: Súťaž o najlepší elixír</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="345,592 356,567 424,585 415,611" text-rotation="345" bgcolor="#d6bc7f">
          <p>Pozvánka</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="36,357 36,8 957,6 959,371 737,372 736,358"/>
      <frame points="130,396 153,375 847,376 859,385 862,595 844,629 156,630 134,621"/>
      <frame points="34,666 50,647 324,646 345,663 346,1316 330,1337 65,1339 36,1324"/>
      <frame points="350,665 365,648 624,647 645,663 644,1317 624,1339 366,1337 349,1320"/>
      <frame points="649,676 660,648 936,648 957,664 956,1310 943,1339 668,1340 649,1324"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E08P03.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="365,146 359,136 362,127 380,117 421,111 483,112 522,119 539,127 542,137 531,147 493,156 435,156 393,154">
          <p>And there we go ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="363,488 360,463 368,445 394,432 450,426 536,427 577,432 600,444 607,472 599,497 567,514 486,519 402,514 369,501">
          <p>... everything is ready, all we need to do now is wait for them to arrive</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="365,146 359,136 362,127 380,117 421,111 483,112 522,119 539,127 542,137 531,147 493,156 435,156 393,154">
          <p>Et voilà ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="363,488 360,463 368,445 394,432 450,426 536,427 577,432 600,444 607,472 599,497 567,514 486,519 402,514 369,501">
          <p>... tout est prêt, il n'y a plus qu'à les attendre</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="365,146 359,136 362,127 380,117 421,111 483,112 522,119 539,127 542,137 531,147 493,156 435,156 393,154">
          <p>Tak a je to ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="363,488 360,463 368,445 394,432 450,426 536,427 577,432 600,444 607,472 599,497 567,514 486,519 402,514 369,501">
          <p>... všetko je pripravené, teraz môžeme iba čakať, kým neprídu</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="35,85 61,26 616,5 956,15 957,383 37,386"/>
      <frame points="35,400 957,400 956,852 37,852"/>
      <frame points="35,867 956,866 960,1337 36,1337"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E08P04.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="352,139 334,132 331,118 349,104 418,97 493,103 528,114 532,125 523,138 509,136 355,136">
          <p>But I'm sure that ...</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="358,138 503,138 502,162 360,162">
          <p>I'm certain ...</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="437,167 588,167 594,189 577,194 438,193">
          <p>... they'll come ...</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="352,139 334,132 331,118 349,104 418,97 493,103 528,114 532,125 523,138 509,136 355,136">
          <p>Mais si,</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="358,138 503,138 502,162 360,162">
          <p> je suis sûre...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="437,167 588,167 594,189 577,194 438,193">
          <p>...elles viendront</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="352,139 334,132 331,118 349,104 418,97 493,103 528,114 532,125 523,138 509,136 355,136">
          <p>Ale som si istá, že ...</p></text-area>
        <text-area points="358,138 503,138 502,162 360,162">
          <p>... určite ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="437,167 588,167 594,189 577,194 438,193">
          <p>... oni prídu ...</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="39,11 954,11 954,463 39,463"/>
      <frame points="38,484 955,484 957,931 37,931"/>
      <frame points="38,949 955,949 956,1336 37,1336"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E08P05.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="46,114 46,15 245,15 243,100 181,112">
          <p>How could they do this to me?!! To <emphasis>me</emphasis>!!!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="652,648 649,601 675,597 811,597 843,611 832,645 819,654">
          <p>... since I can't count on them ...</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="46,114 46,15 245,15 243,100 181,112">
          <p>Comment peuvent-elles me faire ça?!! à <emphasis>moi</emphasis>!!!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="652,648 649,601 675,597 811,597 843,611 832,645 819,654">
          <p>... puisque je ne peux pas compter sur elles!</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="46,114 46,15 245,15 243,100 181,112">
          <p>Ako mi to len mohli urobiť?!! <emphasis>Mne</emphasis>!!!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="652,648 649,601 675,597 811,597 843,611 832,645 819,654">
          <p>... keďže sa na ne nedá spoľahnúť ...</p></text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="955,7 956,399 38,397 38,7"/>
      <frame points="37,417 955,416 956,1050 37,1052"/>
      <frame points="37,1069 955,1067 957,1337 39,1337 38,1301 24,1299 38,1272"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E08P06.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="66,58 60,33 82,15 138,9 270,13 284,28 281,51 224,75 157,75 91,71" bgcolor="#0f0f0f">
          <p><inverted>Monšters of Chaosáh át your šervice</inverted></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="704,74 677,56 677,29 688,17 868,17 880,33 881,52 833,77" bgcolor="#0f0f0f">
          <p><inverted>Who do yôu wišh uš to <emphasis>átack?</emphasis></inverted></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="576,1334 894,1334 894,1364 576,1364">
          <p>Episode 8: Pepper's Birthday Party</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="66,58 60,33 82,15 138,9 270,13 284,28 281,51 224,75 157,75 91,71" bgcolor="#0f0f0f">
          <p><inverted>Monštŗes de Chaosāh à votre šeŗvice!</inverted></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="704,74 677,56 677,29 688,17 868,17 880,33 881,52 833,77" bgcolor="#0f0f0f">
          <p><inverted>Qui devonš-nous <emphasis>attaqueŗ?...</emphasis></inverted></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="576,1334 894,1334 894,1364 576,1364">
          <p>Episode 8: L'anniversaire de Pepper</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="66,58 60,33 82,15 138,9 270,13 284,28 281,51 224,75 157,75 91,71" bgcolor="#0f0f0f">
          <p><inverted>Monštrá Chaosu k vašej dispozícii</inverted></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="704,74 677,56 677,29 688,17 868,17 880,33 881,52 833,77" bgcolor="#0f0f0f">
          <p><inverted>Na koho si želáte, aby sme <emphasis>zaútočili?</emphasis></inverted></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="576,1334 894,1334 894,1364 576,1364">
          <p>Epizóda 8: Narodeninová párty pre Pepper</p>
        </text-area>
