      <frame points="38,772 957,773 955,1334 37,1337"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E08P07.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="70,28 918,28 918,91 71,91">
          <p>Pepper&amp;Carrot is entirely free, open-source, and sponsored thanks to the kind patronage of readers. For this episode, thank you to the 354 Patrons:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="343,749 659,749 659,795 341,795">
          <p>You too can become a patron of Pepper&amp;Carrot for the next episode:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="344,819 630,819 630,861 348,861">
          <p>License: Creative Commons Attribution You can modify, reshare, sell etc ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="208,861 781,861 781,925 206,925">
          <p>Open-source: all source files with layers and fonts are available on the official site.</p><p>Tools: This episode was 100% drawn with Free/Libre software Krita, Inkscape on GNU/Linux</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="70,28 918,28 918,91 71,91">
          <p>Pepper&amp;Carrot est entièrement gratuit, open-source, et sponsorisé grâce au mécénat des lecteurs. Pour cet épisode, merci aux 354 Mécènes:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="343,749 659,749 659,795 341,795">
          <p>Vous aussi, devenez mécène de Pepper&amp;Carrot pour le prochain épisode:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="344,819 630,819 630,861 348,861">
          <p>License : Creative Commons Attribution vous pouvez modifier, repartager, vendre, etc...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="208,861 781,861 781,925 206,925">
          <p>Open-source : toutes les sources, polices d'écritures, fichiers avec calques sont disponibles sur le site officiel au téléchargement.</p><p>Tools : Cet épisode a été dessiné a 100% avec des logiciels libres Krita, Inkscape sur GNU/Linux</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="70,28 918,28 918,91 71,91">
          <p>Komiks Pepper&amp;Carrot je úplne zadarmo, open-source, a sponzorovaný vďaka podpore čitateľov. Za túto epizódu patrí vďaka 354 podporovateľom:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="343,749 659,749 659,795 341,795">
          <p>Ty sa tiež môžeš stať podporovateľom Pepper&amp;Carrot pre ďaľšiu epizódu:</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="344,819 630,819 630,861 348,861">
          <p>Licencia: Creative Commons Attribution Je možné upravovať, zdieľať, predávať atď ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="208,861 781,861 781,925 206,925">
          <p>Open-source: všetky zdrojové súbory s vrstvami a fontami sú k dispozícii na oficiálnej stránke.</p><p>Nástroje: Táto epizóda bola 100% kreslená pomocou slobodného software-u Krita, Inkscape na operačnom systéme GNU/Linux</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
    </page>
    <page>
      <title lang="fr">Episode 9: Le remède</title>
      <title lang="sk">Epizóda 9: Náprava</title>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E09.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="146,647 151,630 160,622 173,615 821,615 839,624 847,637 849,650 843,666 834,676 819,682 171,682 158,674 148,662" bgcolor="#ccd57a" type="heading">
          <p>Episode 9: The Remedy</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="146,647 151,630 160,622 173,615 821,615 839,624 847,637 849,650 843,666 834,676 819,682 171,682 158,674 148,662" bgcolor="#ccd57a" type="heading">
          <p>Episode 9: Le remède</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="146,647 151,630 160,622 173,615 821,615 839,624 847,637 849,650 843,666 834,676 819,682 171,682 158,674 148,662" bgcolor="#ccd57a" type="heading">
          <p>Epizóda 9: Náprava</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
    <title lang="en">Episode 9: The Remedy</title></page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E09P01.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="41,2 233,2 233,50 42,50" bgcolor="#e5d188" type="commentary">
          <p>The day after the party *</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="661,694 952,694 952,716 660,716">
          <p>*See Episode 8: Pepper's Birthday Party</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="89,803 89,774 104,754 133,739 215,737 300,749 324,772 331,805 306,836 188,850 137,846 99,825">
          <p>Huh? The signal of the mountains, the forest, and the clouds?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="197,853 311,838 343,843 358,860 356,875 332,888 251,893 222,888 198,873">
          <p>But why?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="122,1230 129,1208 171,1186 243,1197 262,1223 242,1244 181,1249 137,1244">
          <p>Oh no!</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="41,2 233,2 233,50 42,50" bgcolor="#e5d188" type="commentary">
          <p>Le lendemain de la fête* ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="661,694 952,694 952,716 660,716">
          <p>* voir episode 8: L'anniversaire de Pepper</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="89,803 89,774 104,754 133,739 215,737 300,749 324,772 331,805 306,836 188,850 137,846 99,825">
          <p>Tiens, le signal des montagnes, de la forêt et des nuages?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="197,853 311,838 343,843 358,860 356,875 332,888 251,893 222,888 198,873">
          <p>Mais pourquoi?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="122,1230 129,1208 171,1186 243,1197 262,1223 242,1244 181,1249 137,1244">
          <p>Oh non!</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="41,2 233,2 233,50 42,50" bgcolor="#e5d188" type="commentary">
          <p>Nasledujúci deň po párty *</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="661,694 952,694 952,716 660,716">
          <p>*Pozri Epizódu 8: Narodeninová párty pre Pepper</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="89,803 89,774 104,754 133,739 215,737 300,749 324,772 331,805 306,836 188,850 137,846 99,825">
          <p>Čože? Značky pohoria, lesa a mrakov?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="197,853 311,838 343,843 358,860 356,875 332,888 251,893 222,888 198,873">
          <p>Ale prečo?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="122,1230 129,1208 171,1186 243,1197 262,1223 242,1244 181,1249 137,1244">
          <p>Oh nie!</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="36,84 23,71 22,1 267,0 268,9 955,11 955,714 663,714 662,695 39,696"/>
      <frame points="39,715 955,717 956,1105 38,1104"/>
      <frame points="39,1124 955,1124 956,1336 39,1335"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E09P02.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="77,77 76,61 89,49 124,43 174,43 205,51 218,65 200,83 172,99 109,98 82,87">
          <p><strong>Sorry...</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="177,102 224,69 288,64 347,71 388,89 403,116 389,152 352,172 302,183 236,177 197,160 175,135">
          <p>I completely forgot to turn off my "security system"</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="60,585 49,567 56,546 84,529 139,521 219,521 273,530 297,543 304,564 295,583 278,594 83,595">
          <p>... but I'm so happy that you all came!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="72,634 75,614 86,599 279,597 300,607 307,624 304,639 285,655 124,659 91,649">
          <p>But other than that, how was your night?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="114,695 115,679 128,662 287,659 299,674 303,692 285,712 253,722 204,726 140,719 118,705">
          <p>A little light rain I believe? ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="142,988 141,970 157,949 202,933 260,929 300,940 327,961 334,984 321,1008 240,1026 188,1023 159,1009">
          <p>... I'm sorry, but no harm done, right?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="228,1084 229,1056 245,1029 332,1010 407,1014 453,1028 479,1049 485,1081 475,1108 440,1130 379,1140 311,1137 257,1121 231,1096">
          <p>I've prepared tea so we can all get our good humour back after this little mishap!</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="77,77 76,61 89,49 124,43 174,43 205,51 218,65 200,83 172,99 109,98 82,87">
          <p><strong>Désolée...</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="177,102 224,69 288,64 347,71 388,89 403,116 389,152 352,172 302,183 236,177 197,160 175,135">
          <p>J'ai complètement oublié de désactiver mon "système de sécurité"...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="60,585 49,567 56,546 84,529 139,521 219,521 273,530 297,543 304,564 295,583 278,594 83,595">
          <p>... mais je suis si contente que vous soyez toutes venues! ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="72,634 75,614 86,599 279,597 300,607 307,624 304,639 285,655 124,659 91,649">
          <p>Et sinon, comment s'est passée la nuit?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="114,695 115,679 128,662 287,659 299,674 303,692 285,712 253,722 204,726 140,719 118,705">
          <p>Un peu pluvieuse je crois, hein?...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="142,988 141,970 157,949 202,933 260,929 300,940 327,961 334,984 321,1008 240,1026 188,1023 159,1009">
          <p>...Je suis si désolée, mais sans rancune, hein?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="228,1084 229,1056 245,1029 332,1010 407,1014 453,1028 479,1049 485,1081 475,1108 440,1130 379,1140 311,1137 257,1121 231,1096">
          <p>J'ai préparé du thé pour qu'on reprenne toutes des forces après cette petite mésaventure.</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="77,77 76,61 89,49 124,43 174,43 205,51 218,65 200,83 172,99 109,98 82,87">
          <p><strong>Prepáč...</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="177,102 224,69 288,64 347,71 388,89 403,116 389,152 352,172 302,183 236,177 197,160 175,135">
          <p>Úplne som zabudla vypnúť môj "bezpečnostný systém"</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="60,585 49,567 56,546 84,529 139,521 219,521 273,530 297,543 304,564 295,583 278,594 83,595">
          <p>... ale som veľmi rada, že ste prišli!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="72,634 75,614 86,599 279,597 300,607 307,624 304,639 285,655 124,659 91,649">
          <p>Odhliadnuc od toho, akú ste mali noc?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="114,695 115,679 128,662 287,659 299,674 303,692 285,712 253,722 204,726 140,719 118,705">
          <p>Trochu zapršalo, myslím ...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="142,988 141,970 157,949 202,933 260,929 300,940 327,961 334,984 321,1008 240,1026 188,1023 159,1009">
          <p>... Je mi to ľúto, ale nič sa vám nestalo, že áno?</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="228,1084 229,1056 245,1029 332,1010 407,1014 453,1028 479,1049 485,1081 475,1108 440,1130 379,1140 311,1137 257,1121 231,1096">
          <p>Pripravila som čaj, aby sme si prinavrátili dobrú náladu po tejto malej nešťastnej nehode!</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="38,9 956,9 956,490 37,492"/>
      <frame points="38,510 954,509 957,899 38,899"/>
      <frame points="38,918 956,916 956,1341 41,1333"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E09P03.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="388,1104 378,1072 398,1036 593,1036 613,1059 603,1098 569,1117 491,1130 420,1121">
          <p>Stupid Pepper! Now it's too late, they all hate me...</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="388,1104 378,1072 398,1036 593,1036 613,1059 603,1098 569,1117 491,1130 420,1121">
          <p>Stupide Pepper! Maintenant c'est trop tard, elles me détestent ...</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="388,1104 378,1072 398,1036 593,1036 613,1059 603,1098 569,1117 491,1130 420,1121">
          <p>Hlúpa Pepper! Teraz je už príliš neskoro, nenávidia ma...</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="38,10 957,9 956,985 37,986"/>
      <frame points="38,1006 956,1004 957,1336 38,1339"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E09P04.webp"/>
      <frame points="38,9 955,9 957,260 37,261"/>
      <frame points="38,281 954,280 957,600 37,601"/>
      <frame points="39,620 955,619 957,1336 37,1337"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E09P05.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="338,1074 338,1050 377,1040 414,1050 411,1075 400,1090 360,1092">
          <p><strong>Vite!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="558,1093 545,1042 567,1037 722,1042 744,1055 738,1087">
          <p>To the laboratory! This can be lethal!</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="338,1074 338,1050 377,1040 414,1050 411,1075 400,1090 360,1092">
          <p><strong>Quick!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="558,1093 545,1042 567,1037 722,1042 744,1055 738,1087">
          <p>Au laboratoire, ça peut être mortel!</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="338,1074 338,1050 377,1040 414,1050 411,1075 400,1090 360,1092">
          <p><strong>Rýchlo!</strong></p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="558,1093 545,1042 567,1037 722,1042 744,1055 738,1087">
          <p>Do laboratória! Toto môže byť smrteľné!</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <frame points="39,8 956,8 956,328 38,330"/>
      <frame points="38,348 955,348 956,996 38,997"/>
      <frame points="38,1015 955,1013 956,1336 38,1337"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E09P06.webp"/>
      <frame points="36,8 315,9 421,476 352,514 37,356"/>
      <frame points="321,7 684,10 569,474 498,438 429,473"/>
      <frame points="688,9 955,9 957,356 641,513 574,477"/>
      <frame points="37,364 347,518 404,824 38,889"/>
      <frame points="350,519 496,442 638,520 578,827 411,826"/>
      <frame points="641,517 955,361 959,889 583,829"/>
      <frame points="38,893 407,828 581,833 959,894 957,1079 38,1079"/>
      <frame points="37,1097 957,1096 957,1338 37,1337"/>
    </page>
    <page>
      <image href="03 - Pepper &amp; Carrot/en_Pepper-and-Carrot_by-David-Revoy_E09P07.webp"/>
      <text-layer lang="en">
        <text-area points="386,62 385,33 467,33 474,52 464,67 400,72">
          <p>Super!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="403,83 457,71 493,78 503,88 502,125 472,134 426,135 401,121 393,104">
          <p>We're the best!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="609,80 576,60 575,47 596,35 640,33 660,51 657,69">
          <p>Yipee!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="505,128 508,85 529,74 563,69 592,77 608,91 612,110 609,125 596,136 561,143 528,140">
          <p>They've been cured!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="279,635 281,619 298,598 335,583 380,577 457,581 513,589 543,603 552,621 551,644 535,661 490,675 417,681 320,668 291,657">
          <p>... It's still a pity that we couldn't avoid the potion's side-effects...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="482,869 483,849 504,819 547,804 622,798 688,804 724,817 746,849 746,880 727,908 684,923 617,926 524,914 496,898">
          <p>Don't worry; the fur and feather loss is temporary, it'll grow back quickly</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="fr">
        <text-area points="386,62 385,33 467,33 474,52 464,67 400,72">
          <p>Super!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="403,83 457,71 493,78 503,88 502,125 472,134 426,135 401,121 393,104">
          <p>On est les meilleures!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="609,80 576,60 575,47 596,35 640,33 660,51 657,69">
          <p>Yihaaa!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="505,128 508,85 529,74 563,69 592,77 608,91 612,110 609,125 596,136 561,143 528,140">
          <p>Ils sont guéris!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="279,635 281,619 298,598 335,583 380,577 457,581 513,589 543,603 552,621 551,644 535,661 490,675 417,681 320,668 291,657">
          <p>... c'est quand même dommage qu'on n'ait pas pu empêcher les effets secondaires de la potion.</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="482,869 483,849 504,819 547,804 622,798 688,804 724,817 746,849 746,880 727,908 684,923 617,926 524,914 496,898">
          <p>T'inquiète pas; la perte des poils et des plumes ne sera que temporaire, ça repoussera vite.</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
      <text-layer lang="sk">
        <text-area points="386,62 385,33 467,33 474,52 464,67 400,72">
          <p>Super!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="403,83 457,71 493,78 503,88 502,125 472,134 426,135 401,121 393,104">
          <p>Sme najlepšie!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="609,80 576,60 575,47 596,35 640,33 660,51 657,69">
          <p>Jupííí!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="505,128 508,85 529,74 563,69 592,77 608,91 612,110 609,125 596,136 561,143 528,140">
          <p>Sú vyliečení!</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="279,635 281,619 298,598 335,583 380,577 457,581 513,589 543,603 552,621 551,644 535,661 490,675 417,681 320,668 291,657">
          <p>... Je však škoda, že sme sa nedokázali vyhnúť vedľajším efektom elixíru...</p>
        </text-area>
        <text-area points="482,869 483,849 504,819 547,804 622,798 688,804 724,817 746,849 746,880 727,908 684,923 617,926 524,914 496,898">
          <p>Žiadne starosti; strata kožušiny a peria je iba dočasná, dorastie rýchlo naspäť</p>
        </text-area>
      </text-layer>
